    "title": "Another cold night tonight into Thursday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gunnar Consol ,\n4 hours ago BURLINGTON, Vt. (WCAX) - Last night Saranac Lake was the coldest place in the entire lower 48 with a low temperature of just 1°! And that could be the case again with another cold overnight tonight. Next few days temperatures will continue to fluctuate in and out of the 30s and 40s for highs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
